      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Finland has announced visa restrictions that will prevent Russian athletes, including neutral competitors, from entering the country for sporting events beginning November 16.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-12:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:05Z",
      "text": "Norway has also announced similar restrictions covering Russian and Belarusian athletes and their support staff.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-12:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "The story concerns Finland, the country that announced the visa restrictions.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-12:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:19Z",
